# Scratchpad — ingestion notes

## Pipeline status

- **Sitemap**: 166K URLs discovered (36 sub-sitemaps)
- **Fetched**: ~10 docs (test run), pipeline supports resume
- **Remaining**: ~166K URLs, fetch 500 per run

## Run commands

```bash
# Full pipeline (sitemap + fetch + build)
uv run --project packages/sdk-python python scripts/ingest/run.py --limit 500

# Resume fetching (runs forever until done)
uv run --project packages/sdk-python python scripts/ingest/fetch_documents.py --limit 500

# Just rebuild records from existing source_records.json
uv run --project packages/sdk-python python scripts/ingest/build_records.py
```

## Filter strategy

- **Phase 0**: Fetch everything, filter later
- **Phase 1**: Filter to document pages only (skip `/van-ban/trung-uong` listing pages)
- **Phase 2**: Filter by document type (law, decree, circular) for MVP domains

## Known issues

- Document type detection is URL-based, needs refinement
- Issue dates picking up page dates, not document dates
- No content extraction yet (metadata only)
- Sitemap listing pages (`/van-ban/trung-uong`) included in fetch — should be filtered

## Rate limiting

- 1.5s between requests (vbpl.vn is tolerant but polite)
- ~500 docs = ~12.5 minutes per run
- ~166K docs = ~55 hours total (not blocking, run in background)
